* text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.jar binary
*.lzma binary
*.zip binary
*.pyd binary
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.jks binary

# Fonts. Without these the catch-all `* text eol=lf` above rewrites line endings inside a binary
# and quietly corrupts the file — verified: the first commit of DniFont.ttf did not match the
# working copy.
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary